Calibration of ch(U^dual) on the Gushel--Mukai threefold, k = H.c_2(U^dual):
  chi(U^dual)      = 9 - k   (= 5 since h^0(U^dual) = dim V_5 = 5)
  chi(U^dual, O_X) = 0   (= 0 by semiorthogonality of <Ku, O_X, U^dual>)
  chi(U^dual, U^dual) = 9 - 2*k   (= 1, exceptional)
  all three force k = 4, matching the Schubert computation.

